** 
*Material, name=COHESIVE_IM7_8552
** Penalty stiffness (N/mm^3):  K_nn, K_ss, K_tt
** Ref: Camanho et al. (2003), J. Composite Materials
*Elastic, type=TRACTION
1e+06, 1e+06, 1e+06
** Damage initiation: quadratic stress criterion
** tau_n0 (Mode I), tau_s0 (Mode II), tau_t0 (Mode III)  [MPa]
*Damage Initiation, criterion=QUADS
80, 100, 100
** Damage evolution: BK mixed-mode fracture energy
** GIc, GIIc, GIIIc [N/mm = kJ/m^2],  eta (BK exponent)
*Damage Evolution, type=ENERGY, mixed mode behavior=BK, power=1.45
0.277, 0.788, 0.788
